.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dnglab-ftpserver 1  "dnglab-ftpserver " 
.SH NAME
dnglab\-ftpserver \- Convert raw image(s) into dng format
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdnglab\-ftpserver\fR [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-compression\fR] [\fB\-\-ljpeg92\-predictor\fR] [\fB\-\-lossy\-jpeg\-quality\fR] [\fB\-\-jxl\-distance\fR] [\fB\-\-jxl\-effort\fR] [\fB\-\-jxl\-decode\-speed\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-thumbnail\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-force\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-dng\-force\-thumbnail\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-dng\-backward\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-embed\-raw\fR] [\fB\-\-apply\-dng\-opcodes\fR] [\fB\-\-remove\-dng\-opcodes\fR] [\fB\-\-artist\fR] [\fB\-\-copyright\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\-mtime\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-index\fR] [\fB\-\-crop\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-override\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-listen\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\-original\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert raw image(s) into dng format
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<name>\fR
Convert profile to use for conversion. Built\-in profiles are \*(Aqbuiltin_compat\*(Aq (DNG 1.4.0), \*(Aqbuiltin_latest\*(Aq (DNG 1.6.0),
\*(Aqbuiltin_jxl\*(Aq (JPEG XL lossless, DNG 1.7.1) and \*(Aqbuiltin_archive\*(Aq.
If not given, \*(Aqconvert.default_profile\*(Aq from the dnglab configuration file is used.
Otherwise no profile is used and the command line switches with their defaults apply.
Command line switches override the values of the profile.
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-compression\fR \fI<compression>\fR [default: lossless]
Compression for raw image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
lossless
.IP \(bu 2
lossy
.IP \(bu 2
jxl
.IP \(bu 2
uncompressed
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ljpeg92\-predictor\fR \fI<predictor>\fR [default: 1]
LJPEG\-92 predictor
.TP
\fB\-\-lossy\-jpeg\-quality\fR \fI<quality>\fR [default: 94]
JPEG quality for lossy compression (1\-100)
.TP
\fB\-\-jxl\-distance\fR \fI<distance>\fR [default: 0]
JPEG XL distance (0\-25). 0 is lossless, larger values are lossy and give smaller files.
Lossy compression applies OpcodeList1 to the image data.
.TP
\fB\-\-jxl\-effort\fR \fI<effort>\fR [default: 7]
JPEG XL encoder effort (1\-9)
.TP
\fB\-\-jxl\-decode\-speed\fR \fI<speed>\fR [default: 4]
JPEG XL decoding speed for lossy compression (1\-4)
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-preview\fR \fI<preview>\fR [default: true]
DNG include preview image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-thumbnail\fR \fI<thumbnail>\fR [default: true]
DNG include thumbnail image
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-force\-preview\fR \fI<force_preview>\fR [default: false]
Generate DNG preview image from raw data
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dng\-force\-thumbnail\fR \fI<force_thumbnail>\fR [default: false]
Generate DNG thumbnail image from raw data
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-dng\-backward\-version\fR \fI<version>\fR [default: 1.4]
Maximum DNG backward version
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
1.0
.IP \(bu 2
1.1
.IP \(bu 2
1.2
.IP \(bu 2
1.3
.IP \(bu 2
1.4
.IP \(bu 2
1.5
.IP \(bu 2
1.6
.IP \(bu 2
1.7
.IP \(bu 2
1.7.1
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-embed\-raw\fR \fI<embedded>\fR [default: true]
Embed the raw file into DNG
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-apply\-dng\-opcodes\fR \fI<mode>\fR [default: auto]
Apply DNG opcode lists to the image data instead of writing them to the DNG
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
list1
.IP \(bu 2
list2
.IP \(bu 2
list3
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-dng\-opcodes\fR \fI<opcodes>\fR
Remove DNG opcodes, as comma separated [<list>:]<opcode> (e.g. WarpRectilinear,2:GainMap)
.TP
\fB\-\-artist\fR \fI<artist>\fR
Set the artist tag
.TP
\fB\-\-copyright\fR \fI<copyright>\fR
Set the copyright tag
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-mtime\fR \fI<keepmtime>\fR [default: false]
Keep mtime, read from EXIF with fallback to original file mtime
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-index\fR \fI<index>\fR [default: 0]
Select a specific image index (or \*(Aqall\*(Aq) if file is a image container
.TP
\fB\-\-crop\fR \fI<crop>\fR [default: best]
DNG default crop
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
best
.IP \(bu 2
activearea
.IP \(bu 2
none
.RE
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-override\fR
Override existing files
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<port>\fR [default: 2121]
FTP listen port
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\fR \fI<addr>\fR [default: 0.0.0.0]
FTP listen address
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-original\fR \fI<keep>\fR [default: true]
Keep original raw
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIOUTPUT\fR>
Output file or existing directory
